@ahg-g the name is already validated. The check is the same for every controller (including statefulset).

So you are proposing we do the validation dynamic, based on the `Job.spec.completions`. That works for me. It will give more room for Job name, as not all will use the max possible int32.

Today, the number of completions is immutable, but I'm thinking of changing that in the next release. So, let's check during Update.
